Subject: [PATCH] harfbuzz: mark unused CFF1 subset variable on iOS

The iOS clang build treats the unused CFF1 supplemental-size variable as an
error under this recipe's flags. Mark it unused without changing behavior.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/src/hb-subset-cff1.cc b/src/hb-subset-cff1.cc
--- a/src/hb-subset-cff1.cc	2021-05-03 17:07:06
+++ b/src/hb-subset-cff1.cc	2026-07-05 00:10:46
@@ -405 +405 @@
-    unsigned int  size0, size1, supp_size;
+    unsigned int  size0, size1, __unused supp_size;
